{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/Line01.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/01_HEXAGON.gif?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every shape has a truth behind its face.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cTHANKS, LIGHT.\u201d is a first-person puzzle adventure where geometry, physics, and perception collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Examine the world through light, manipulate dimensions, and uncover shapes that were never what they seemed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/Line02.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/New_EN_02.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/02_LIGHT.gif?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shine light to awaken dimension.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In \u201cTHANKS, LIGHT.\u201d, shining light reveals the object's hidden 3D form\u2014granting it weight, collision, and reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What looked like a simple square might unfold into a staircase. A thin silhouette might mask a towering pillar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use this mechanic to solve puzzles built around spatial insight, object orientation, and hidden structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s not just about what you see \u2014 it\u2019s about what the light reveals..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/Line03.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/New_EN_03.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/03_ABSORB.gif?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn space into silence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Absorbing light strips an object of its volume and mass, flattening it into a static 2D state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A ball that once rolled now rests. A block once blocking your way now slips between the cracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mastering this mechanic is essential for controlling motion, freezing time, and even navigating through narrow impossibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s geometry with gravity off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/Line04.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/New_EN_04.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/04_MODIFY.gif?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Copy. Resize. Fuse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This world is not fixed. Use mirrors to duplicate objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aim through lenses to resize them \u2014 enlarge a key to unlock the unreachable, shrink a shape to fit the impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merge two shapes into one to create entirely new tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles evolve by combining all prior mechanics into layered challenges that reward creativity, not just logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/Line05.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/New_EN_05.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/05_EXPLORE.gif?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A world built for perfection\u2026 until something breaks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture through vast liminal halls designed by a watchful system \u2014 pristine, orderly, and oppressive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At first, you follow the Administrator\u2019s plan. But soon, you encounter a glitch \u2014 a presence that doesn\u2019t belong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As puzzles begin to warp, the structure starts to fracture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not just solving puzzles. You\u2019re navigating a narrative of control, rebellion, and self-awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by backrooms, brutalist architecture, and psychological tension, the story slowly peels itself open \u2014 if you\u2019re paying attention.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2544740?t=1748540099","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748540099","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/1d7b17bf62a51e16cd71576e300df7474dd42217/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748540099","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/1d7b17bf62a51e16cd71576e300df7474dd42217/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748540099","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3276550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/wishlist.gif?t=1748540099\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/Line01.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/01_HEXAGON.gif?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every shape has a truth behind its face.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cTHANKS, LIGHT.\u201d is a first-person puzzle adventure where geometry, physics, and perception collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Examine the world through light, manipulate dimensions, and uncover shapes that were never what they seemed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/Line02.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/New_EN_02.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/02_LIGHT.gif?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shine light to awaken dimension.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In \u201cTHANKS, LIGHT.\u201d, shining light reveals the object's hidden 3D form\u2014granting it weight, collision, and reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What looked like a simple square might unfold into a staircase. A thin silhouette might mask a towering pillar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use this mechanic to solve puzzles built around spatial insight, object orientation, and hidden structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s not just about what you see \u2014 it\u2019s about what the light reveals..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/Line03.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/New_EN_03.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/03_ABSORB.gif?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn space into silence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Absorbing light strips an object of its volume and mass, flattening it into a static 2D state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A ball that once rolled now rests. A block once blocking your way now slips between the cracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mastering this mechanic is essential for controlling motion, freezing time, and even navigating through narrow impossibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s geometry with gravity off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/Line04.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/New_EN_04.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/04_MODIFY.gif?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Copy. Resize. Fuse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This world is not fixed. Use mirrors to duplicate objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aim through lenses to resize them \u2014 enlarge a key to unlock the unreachable, shrink a shape to fit the impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merge two shapes into one to create entirely new tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles evolve by combining all prior mechanics into layered challenges that reward creativity, not just logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/Line05.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/New_EN_05.png?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/05_EXPLORE.gif?t=1748540099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A world built for perfection\u2026 until something breaks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture through vast liminal halls designed by a watchful system \u2014 pristine, orderly, and oppressive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At first, you follow the Administrator\u2019s plan. But soon, you encounter a glitch \u2014 a presence that doesn\u2019t belong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As puzzles begin to warp, the structure starts to fracture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not just solving puzzles. You\u2019re navigating a narrative of control, rebellion, and self-awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by backrooms, brutalist architecture, and psychological tension, the story slowly peels itself open \u2014 if you\u2019re paying attention.</p>","developers":["Lightersgames"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/header.jpg?t=1748540099","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257070789,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257070789/movie480.mp4?t=1746608954","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257070789/movie_max.mp4?t=1746608954"},"name":"Puzzle","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257070789/2af3ce1de3124eaca467fa7382b56c0acb10c63b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746608954","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257070789/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746608954","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257070789/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746608954"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257006912,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257006912/movie480.mp4?t=1746608957","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257006912/movie_max.mp4?t=1746608957"},"name":"Story","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257006912/035b763938b78c63a549e503c9766f34b5a04527/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746608957","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257006912/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746608957","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257006912/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746608957"}}],"name":"THANKS, LIGHT.","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel: 9400 / AMD: 3500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel: 10600 / AMD: 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Lightersgames"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"kgrb":{"rating":"12"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cLike Portal and The Talos Principle, this game features solid puzzle mechanics that enable interaction with distant objects.\u201d<br>Jeep Barnett - Portal developer<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/ss_b39